# Ztockz screen snapshots — every five minutes.
#
# Install with:  crontab deploy/screen-refresh.cron
# (or append the line to the operator's existing crontab).
#
# `flock -n` is the overlap guard: a pass that somehow exceeds five minutes is
# not started a second time. The log lives under out/, which is gitignored.
*/5 * * * * cd /opt/ztockz && flock -n /tmp/ztockz-screen-refresh.lock ./scripts/screen-refresh.sh >> out/screen-refresh.log 2>&1
